      "content": "Your feelings of exhaustion regarding themundane nature of daily life are a common sentiment many people grapple with when questioning the purpose of existence. This perspective can feel overwhelming, but acknowledging it is an important first step toward finding meaning, even in small, self-driven choices. It might be helpful to explore activities that bring you genuine joy or to connect with others who validate these same experiences.",
